        "en": "This seminar is part of the GSoC 2026 Mesa Chinese Developer Training Program, which aims to prepare Chinese developers for Google Summer of Code 2026 with the Mesa framework. The training covers AI-assisted research methodology, including the evolution from traditional programming to AI-driven coding, Vibe Coding principles, and specification-driven development practices.",
